The paired result records, generated tables, and comparison plots are produced
by the automated deterministic evaluation. Consequently, the values in
Tables~\ref{tab:multi_observer_scenario_comparison}
and~\ref{tab:multi_observer_aggregate_comparison} are calculated directly from
the observer outputs rather than transcribed into the manuscript.

\subsubsection{Ten-seed OU-family and adaptation study}

